WHATWG HTML Standard
  https://html.spec.whatwg.org/
  Copyright © WHATWG (Apple, Google, Mozilla, Microsoft).

  prescan.mbt implements "prescan a byte stream to determine its encoding",
  "get an attribute" and "get an XML encoding" (section 13.2.3.2) and "the
  algorithm for extracting a character encoding from a meta element"
  (section 2.5.3), as published on 2026-10-22, and names their steps in
  comments. No text of the standard is copied otherwise. The standard is
  licensed under CC BY 4.0; its portions incorporated into source code are
  licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License.

  sniff.mbt implements the "encoding sniffing algorithm" of the same
  section, as published on 2026-10-22, apart from the steps that depend on
  the browser.

